OL,3,GNEWSAVillage with #16k new shelters
OL,4,Acould lose bus link
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village faces losing its bus service
OL,7,Fmonths after #16,000 was spent on two
OL,8,Fnew passenger shelters.
OL,10,FThey were installed in Kirtling and
OL,11,FUpend in east Cambridgeshire in July,
OL,12,Fafter the parish council secured
OL,13,Ffunding for the project.
OL,15,FBut the Cambridgeshire and Peterborough
OL,16,FCombined Authority (CPCA) is now
OL,17,Fconsidering withdrawing the village's
OL,18,Fbus routes, as part of a county-wide
OL,19,Frevision of services.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
