OL,3,GNEWSAVillage with #16k new shelters
OL,4,Acould lose bus link
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Under those proposals, a small number
OL,7,Fof communities where usage was
OL,8,Fextremely low would no longer be served
OL,9,Fby a fixed line bus," a CPCA
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
